  "details": "Currently in the VRChat UI, if you go to someone's listing on the marketplace, the \"More From This Creator\" section will only feature the latest 8 avatars on the marketplace from that creator and no dropdown to view older listings. This can become problematic as more avatar listings are created by a seller, older ones can get drowned out and receive less visibility, I believe having a dropdown appear would be beneficial to both buyers and sellers. World creators already have a dropdown menu in the \"More From This Creator\" section where you can view every world uploaded by a user.\n\nAlso, if you select an avatar that from \"More From This Creator\", the listing doesn't get replaced by another listing, it just disappears from the section.",
